// Resources (docs/game_design.md §4). Gold is the treasury, not a resource.
// Fields: id, name (German), category (Raw | Food | Goods | Luxury), base_price (gold),
// nutrition (saturation per unit, food only), heating_value (warmth per unit in winter),
// import_only (cannot be produced, only bought from other kingdoms), household_use (units a
// household uses per resident and day while its housing tier asks for the good, doc §6).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
    // ---- Rohstoffe -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    (id: "wood",       name: "Holz",              category: Raw,    base_price: 4,  heating_value: 1.0),
    (id: "stone",      name: "Stein",             category: Raw,    base_price: 5),
    (id: "loam",       name: "Lehm",              category: Raw,    base_price: 3),
    (id: "clay",       name: "Ton",               category: Raw,    base_price: 4),
